From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:59:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Logo: add a small AROS logo

Repository: https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch
Base: fastfetch 2.70.0, 17bb3fd2384bd814b421d73b8c8b8d08e06cfa26
Problem: the AROS logo (patch 0001) takes 33 columns; next to it the
longer module lines no longer fit an 80-column Shell window and wrapped
under the logo. There was no small variant for --logo-type small.
Solution: aros_small, the word AROS in four lines of 21 columns, drawn
for this port (no existing artwork used).
Scope: src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt and its entry in a.inc; no code.
Upstream-Status: suitable for upstream with 0001.
Verification: guest runs: docs/evidence/2026-10-27-r2/.
Removal: when upstream fastfetch ships AROS logos.
---
 src/logo/ascii/a.inc            | 13 +++++++++++++
 src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt |  4 ++++
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt

diff --git a/src/logo/ascii/a.inc b/src/logo/ascii/a.inc
index 3ecad08..79efa91 100644
--- a/src/logo/ascii/a.inc
+++ b/src/logo/ascii/a.inc
@@ -654,6 +654,19 @@ static const FFlogo A[] = {
         .colorTitle = FF_COLOR_FG_BLUE,
     },
     #endif
+    #ifdef FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_AROS_SMALL
+    // AROSSmall
+    {
+        .names = { "aros_small" },
+        .type = FF_LOGO_LINE_TYPE_SMALL_BIT,
+        .lines = FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_AROS_SMALL,
+        .colors = {
+            FF_COLOR_FG_BLUE,
+        },
+        .colorKeys = FF_COLOR_FG_BLUE,
+        .colorTitle = FF_COLOR_FG_BLUE,
+    },
+    #endif
     #ifdef FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_ARTIX
     // Artix
     {
diff --git a/src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt b/src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f720f53
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/logo/ascii/a/aros_small.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+$1   _   ___  ___  ___
+$1  /_\ | _ \/ _ \/ __|
+$1 / _ \|   / (_) \__ \
+$1/_/ \_\_|_\\___/|___/
